     .columns {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            gap: 60px;\n            flex: 1;\n        }\n        .left-col {\n            flex: 1;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 30px;\n        }\n        .right-col {\n            flex: 1;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n        p {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .highlight {\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #EB5E28;\n        }\n        .quote-box {\n            background-color: rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.1);\n            border-left: 6px solid #EB5E28;\n            padding: 25px;\n            margin-top: auto;\n        }\n        .quote-text {\n            font-size: 22px;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #252422;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .quote-author {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #EB5E28;\n        }\n        ul {\n            list-style-type: none;\n        }\n        li {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n            position: relative;\n            padding-left: 35px;\n        }\n        li::before {\n            content: \"•\";\n            color: #EB5E28;\n            font-size: 40px;\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            top: -12px;\n        }\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"slide-container\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"shape-1\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"shape-2\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"content-wrapper\"\u003e\n            \u003ch1\u003eThe World Has Changed — But Our Signals Haven't\u003c/h1\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"columns\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"left-col\"\u003e\n                    \u003cp\u003eThe World Economic Forum projects that \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003e44% of workers' core skills will be disrupted by 2027\u003c/span\u003e. Employers are rapidly shifting to skills-first hiring strategies. Yet the tools learners use to demonstrate readiness — transcripts, GPAs, and resumes — were designed for a different era.\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003cp\u003eLeadership, resilience, collaboration, empathy, and creative problem-solving are the skills that predict long-term success. \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eNone of them appear on a transcript.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-box\"\u003e\n                        \u003cp class=\"quote-text\"\u003e\"The limitation is not conceptual but structural. Existing systems lack the ability to translate human development into verifiable, portable signals.\"\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003cp class=\"quote-author\"\u003e— Skills Passport White Paper, 2026\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"right-col\"\u003e\n                    \u003cul\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGPAs and grades\u003c/strong\u003e measure knowledge recall, not real-world capability.\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDurable skill gaps\u003c/strong\u003e persist across every major sector (McKinsey Global Institute).\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCredential transparency\u003c/strong\u003e is now a federal and state policy priority.\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLearners from under-resourced communities\u003c/strong\u003e are disproportionately invisible in traditional systems.\u003c/li\u003e\n                    \u003c/ul\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_3_shared_problem","path":"/home/ubuntu/pitch_deck/presentation/slide_3_shared_problem.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@500;800\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .slide-container { \n            width: 1280px; \n            min-height: 720px; \n            background-color: #FFFCF2; \n            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            color: #403D39;\n            padding-top: 60px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n        .shape-1 {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n            width: 800px;\n            height: 800px;\n            background-color: #EB5E28;\n            opacity: 0.04;\n            border-radius: 40% 60% 50% 50% / 50% 40% 60% 50%;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .content-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 2;\n            width: 1160px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            height: 600px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #252422;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .intro {\n            font-size: 22px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            color: #EB5E28;\n        }\n        .columns-container {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            gap: 40px;\n            flex: 1;\n        }\n        .column {\n            flex: 1;\n            background-color: rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.05);\n            padding: 40px 30px;\n            border-top: 6px solid #EB5E28;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .col-title {\n            font-size: 28px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #252422;\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n        .col-text {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .footer-statement {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #252422;\n            padding: 20px;\n            background-color: rgba(37, 36, 34, 0.05);\n        }\n        .highlight {\n            color: #EB5E28;\n        }\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"slide-container\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"shape-1\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"content-wrapper\"\u003e\n            \u003ch1\u003eThree Systems. One Shared Problem.\u003c/h1\u003e\n            \u003cp class=\"intro\"\u003eThe mismatch between human potential and opportunity affects every stakeholder in the ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \n            \u003cdiv class=\"columns-container\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"column\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"col-title\"\u003eLearners\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cp class=\"col-text\"\u003eStrengths built through mentoring, service, and projects never appear in formal records. \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eSkills don't travel.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"column\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"col-title\"\u003eEmployers\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cp class=\"col-text\"\u003eDegrees substitute for capability. \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eMismatch is the default.\u003c/span\u003e Reliable hiring signals are absent for entry-level roles.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"column\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"col-title\"\u003eInstitutions \u0026 Policy\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cp class=\"col-text\"\u003eWorkforce decisions are made without reliable skill data. \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eEducation outputs rarely match employer needs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \n            \u003cdiv class=\"footer-statement\"\u003e\n                When potential is invisible, mobility slows — and the full picture of readiness stays incomplete for everyone.\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_4_root_cause","path":"/home/ubuntu/pitch_deck/presentation/slide_4_root_cause.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@500;800\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .slide-container { \n            width: 1280px; \n            min-height: 720px; \n            background-color: #FFFCF2; \n            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            color: #403D39;\n            padding-top: 60px;\n        }\n        .shape-1 {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -150px;\n            left: -100px;\n            width: 500px;\n            height: 500px;\n            background-color: #EB5E28;\n            opacity: 0.05;\n            border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .shape-2 {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -100px;\n            right: -50px;\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 400px;\n            background-color: #EB5E28;\n            opacity: 0.08;\n            border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .content-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 2;\n            width: 1160px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            height: 600px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 48px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #252422;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .intro {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #EB5E28;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .columns {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 80px;\n            flex: 1;\n        }\n        .col {\n            flex: 1;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 45px;\n        }\n        .item {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n        .number {\n            font-size: 72px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.2);\n            line-height: 0.8;\n            min-width: 50px;\n            text-align: right;\n        }\n        .text h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #252422;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .text p {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"slide-container\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"shape-1\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"shape-2\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"content-wrapper\"\u003e\n            \u003ch1\u003eThe Root Cause Is Structural, Not Conceptual\u003c/h1\u003e\n            \u003cp class=\"intro\"\u003eFive interconnected failures create the current gap:\u003c/p\u003e\n            \n            \u003cdiv class=\"columns\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"col\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"item\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"number\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"text\"\u003e\n                            \u003ch3\u003eMeasurement Misalignment\u003c/h3\u003e\n                            \u003cp\u003eTraditional assessments prioritize standardized knowledge tests that cannot capture collaboration, initiative, or adaptive problem-solving.\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"item\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"number\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"text\"\u003e\n                            \u003ch3\u003eFragmented Evidence\u003c/h3\u003e\n                            \u003cp\u003eHuman development occurs across schools, workplaces, families, and communities, but existing systems capture evidence in isolation.\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"item\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"number\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"text\"\u003e\n                            \u003ch3\u003eThe Verification Gap\u003c/h3\u003e\n                            \u003cp\u003eWithout verification, systems cannot distinguish between demonstrated and perceived ability. Self-report is unreliable.\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"col\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"item\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"number\"\u003e4\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"text\"\u003e\n                            \u003ch3\u003eNo Developmental Representation\u003c/h3\u003e\n                            \u003cp\u003eMost systems treat skills as static attributes rather than developmental processes. Binary classifications obscure growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"item\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"number\"\u003e5\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"text\"\u003e\n                            \u003ch3\u003eSystem-Level Consequences\u003c/h3\u003e\n                            \u003cp\u003eEmployers lack reliable hiring signals, learners cannot demonstrate growth, and education systems struggle to align with workforce demands.\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_5_introducing_mfc","path":"/home/ubuntu/pitch_deck/presentation/slide_5_introducing_mfc.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@500;800\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cs