\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"stack-title\"\u003eAudit \u0026 Appeal\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"stack-desc\"\u003eTransparent dispute resolution with a tiered model.\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \n                \u003cdiv class=\"right-col\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"info-block\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"info-title\"\u003eConfidence as Evidence Strength\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cp class=\"info-text\"\u003eConfidence is presented as evidence strength, not a deficit indicator. This protects nontraditional learners who may have fewer formal verification sources but strong underlying capacity.\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"progression\"\u003e\n                            Emerging \u003cspan\u003e\u0026rarr;\u003c/span\u003e Established \u003cspan\u003e\u0026rarr;\u003c/span\u003e Verified\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \n                    \u003cdiv class=\"info-block\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"info-title\"\u003eDesigned for Scale\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cp class=\"info-text\"\u003eDispute resolution is optimized to keep expert adjudication costs minimal:\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003cp class=\"info-text\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003e~3–7%\u003c/span\u003e dispute rate overall\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003cp class=\"info-text\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003e~80%\u003c/span\u003e resolved automatically at Tier 1\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_9_recruiter_experience"