u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"grid-number\"\u003e03\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"grid-title\"\u003ePolicy demands career-connected evidence\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"grid-text\"\u003eFederal and state priorities increasingly connect learning to documented career pathways, with funding tied to measurable outcomes.\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"grid-item\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"grid-number\"\u003e04\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"grid-title\"\u003eToo much stays hidden\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"grid-text\"\u003eTranscripts alone cannot capture the strengths that predict success in work, community, and life.\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \n            \u003cdiv class=\"footer-block\"\u003e\n                \u003cp class=\"footer-text\"\u003eThe competitive landscape confirms the gap: career tools like Naviance exist, skill frameworks like Open Skills Network exist — \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003ebut no one has built the verification layer.\u003c/span\u003e Skills Passport fills that gap.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_11_traction","path":"/home/ubuntu/pitch_deck/presentation/slide_11_traction.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@500;800\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .slide-container { \n            width: 1280px; \n            min-height: 720px; \n            backgro