on, highest-value entry point: \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eworkforce-aligned education for learners ages 16–24.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n            \n            \u003cdiv class=\"columns\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"col\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"section-title\"\u003ePrimary Wedge Markets\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eCommunity colleges\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eWorkforce development programs\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eCareer Technical Education (CTE) pathways\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \n                    \u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"section-title\"\u003eWhy This Wedge Works\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"strong-text\"\u003eImmediate employer pain:\u003c/span\u003e No reliable entry-level candidate signals exist.\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"strong-text\"\u003ePolicy alignment:\u003c/span\u003e Federal and state funding prioritizes workforce alignment and measurable outcomes.\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"strong-text\"\u003eContained ecosystems:\u003c/span\u003e Programs already track cohorts, making pilot implementation feasible.\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \n                \u003cdiv class=\"col\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"section-title\"\u003eExpansion Path\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cul class=\"phase-list\"\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"strong-text\"\u003ePhase 1:\u003c/span\u003e Workforce-aligned education programs (current)\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"strong-text\"\u003ePhase 2:\u003c/span\u003e Employer hiring pipelines for entry-level roles\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"strong-text\"\u003ePhase 3:\u003c/span\u003e Broader workforce credential ecosystem\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \n                    \u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class=\"section-title\"\u003eAnchor Payor Strategy\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cp class=\"text-block\"\u003eInitial deployment is best positioned through public-private workforce grants, aligning the system with existing investments in labor-market efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eState workforce agencies\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eRegional workforce development boards\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_13_business_model","path":"/home/ubuntu/pitch_deck/presentation/slide_13_business_model.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@500;800\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .slide-container { \n            width: 1280